        <mxCell id="legendBox" value="Request Lifecycle&#10;1. Browser → App Runner (HTTPS, cookie session)&#10;2. App Runner → AgentCore (SigV4, InvokeAgentRuntime)&#10;3. Agent → KB (bedrock:Retrieve, top-K=5)&#10;4. KB → OpenSearch Serverless (vector search)&#10;5. Agent → Claude Sonnet 4.6 (bedrock:Converse)&#10;6. Agent → Secrets Manager (Teams webhook)&#10;7. (Optional) Agent → Teams (Adaptive Card)&#10;8. App Runner → Browser (rendered HTML)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="420" y="780" width="450" height="160" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="legendDesign" value="Key Design Decisions&#10;• AgentCore Runtime — scales to zero, ARM64, native Bedrock auth&#10;• Cross-region inference profile (us.) — required for Claude 4.x&#10;• OpenSearch Serverless — auto-scaling vector index for KB&#10;• App Runner — managed TLS, idle-to-zero, one-command deploy&#10;• FastAPI (not Streamlit) — no WebSocket → Envoy-compatible&#10;• Basic-auth at UI; SigV4 between AWS services&#10;• Secrets Manager — Teams webhook + UI password&#10;• Stateless agent · cookie session in UI memory" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFAEC;strokeColor=#D4A017;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="900" y="780" width="690" height="160" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

